Yes it could be a problem with that configuration. I took a look at mapred-site.xml and there is a max of 4 reduce tasks, but none on the map tasks, at least not global (there is a max of two per tasktracker, how many task nodes do you have?). I did a quick test on a million element vector and I got it to use 4 map tasks.

> >
> > given the vector isn't large...i.e. only 50 elements...im not sure how scatter would help...and if it does...how would I integrate it into the function?

mapreduce(input, ...)

becomes

mapreduce(scatter(input) ...

Antonio

