I know hadoop can work with gzip and bzip2 compressed data. Are there any issues using rmr2 with either of these formats? I did a quick test about a week ago and it seemed like it failed to read the data. The files are DEL delimited text files that have been compressed due to their size. I am aware of hadoops regular issues with gzip files and splitting them but that's not currently a concern.

